## Centrar elemento ##

<div class="col75p terminal example">
&lt;div style="
     width: 100px; height: <span class=focus>100px</span>; 
     background: #228; color: white; 
     border-radius: 10px; 
     <span class=focus>margin: auto</span>; 
     <span class=focus>position: relative</span>; 
     <span class=focus>top: 50%</span>; 
     <span class=focus>margin-top: -50px</span>;
     line-height: 100px</span>; 
     text-align: center;"> OK &lt;/div>
</div>
<div class=col25p style="height: 280px; background: orange; opacity: .5;">
<div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; background: #228; color: white; border-radius: 10px; margin: auto; position: relative; top: 50%; margin-top: -50px;line-height: 100px; text-align: center;">OK</div>

</div>


* Centrar horizontalmente: <class class=focus>margin: auto</class>;
* Centrar verticalmente:
    * Posicionar relativamente o botão
    * Deslocar 50% <span class=litle>(1/2 da altura do contentor)
    * Compensar 1/2 altura botão <span class=litle>(<class class=focus>margin-top: -50px</class>)